The best thing to polymorph into is a Vampire Lord.  They have 18/**
strength, can wear all your armor and wield your weapon, they suck lives
from victims, and they levitate but can still pick up stuff (very useful
in trap-heavy areas or around water).

There are other cool things in certain situations; Xorns are great if
you need to get through walls (they make the endgame real easy).
The other day I polymorphed into a rock mole to eat my iron ball
(This iron ball is delicious!).  Once I had no way to blind myself,
so I polymorphed myself into a lizard and carried my mirror to kill
Medusa (lizards, by the way, can carry a mirror, but aren't strong
enough to walk up the stairs with one, and you have to drop *everything*
else).

A cockatrice is also an interesting polymorph, but they're really weak.
Marlyths get lots of attacks but can't wield weapons.  And, of course,
if you're any of the dragons or nagas you can lay eggs which will 
eventually hatch and become your followers; dragons and nagas can't
wear armor, however.
